{
  "Script": "Story/Common/Quest/IcOhshima/Quest_Lv2_IcOhshima",
  "Entries": [
    {
      "Context": "SetPeriodText:0",
      "Original": "Head to the open air stage at Narby Square!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "SetPeriodText:0",
      "Original": "Head to the arena!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04258_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalkMonolog:0",
      "Original": "(Ah, it's Icchi. She's studying hard as always.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04259_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalkMonolog:0",
      "Original": "(She must really love studying...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04260_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Piipiipiipiipii BAAA pwiiGAApwiiGAApwii-PYSSHHHKKK.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04261_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Mngh?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04262_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Sigh.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04263_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalkMonolog:0",
      "Original": "(What's with that ancient internet connection sound? What's going on here?)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04264_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Erm...Icchi?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04265_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ah... K-Kayamori? By chance, did you...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04266_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Piipiipiipiipii BAAA pwiiGAApwiiGAApwii-PYSSHHHKKK.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04267_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Aah!!! You <i>did</i> hear it! You even copied it sound-for-sound!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04268_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So like, what was that?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04269_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Erm, sometimes it just happens when I study.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04270_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "My chest starts feeling weird...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04271_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Like, a bittersweet, almost painful feeling of being embraced.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04272_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You're making it sound like you're in love...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04273_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But I bet what's really going on is that your body's stressed out from studying.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04274_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No. As the eldest of my sisters, I don't feel stress.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04275_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wait. Shouldn't the eldest be the most stressed out one?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04276_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That's not true. After all, my sisters are all very cute.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04277_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That's right! I need to get back to studying and become better for their sake!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04278_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Piipiipiipiipii BAAA pwiiGAApwiiGAApwii-PYSSHHHKKK.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04279_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "See? That connection sound is back. I really think you need a break. Everyone's gotta de-stress sometimes.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04280_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "De-stress?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04281_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We gotta figure out a way to de-stress ASAP!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04282_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Then I suppose I should study the mechanisms of how stress works and...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04283_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Piipiipiipiipii BAAA pwiiGAApwiiGAApwii-PYSSHHHKKK.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04284_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "Icchi!!! Get yourself together!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04285_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "*gasp* What...was I doing?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04286_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Okay, I'm gonna help you get rid of this stress! Let's do something fun!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04287_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I think screaming is a good way to get stress out.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04288_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That sounds a little...embarrassing.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04289_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's better than sounding like the internet.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04290_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Okay, why don't we go somewhere less embarrassing then?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04291_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Okay, we're here.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04292_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What are we doing here?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04293_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We're here to scream our hearts out. You've heard how going to karaoke is a good way to relieve stress, right?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04294_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Huh...? But even if you ask me to scream... What should I even say?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04295_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Anything you like! Anything you want to scream from your heart!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04296_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "From my heart?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04297_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Okay, I will give it a shot.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04298_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Here goes... *ahem*",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04299_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutInWithAct:5",
      "Original": "CAPITALISM SUCKS!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04300_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, so that's what in your heart?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04301_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "SOCIAL INEQUALITY CAN GO TO HELL!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04302_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "CAPITALISTS NEED TO STOP MONOPOLIZING WEALTH!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04303_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's starting to sound like some kind of protest.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04304_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "DO YOU WANNA GO TO NEW YORK?!\\nI DO!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04305_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Now it sounds like a concert! But I guess that's what's in her heart!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04306_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "Niina! Minori! Yostsuha! Isuzu! Muua!\\nI LOVE ALL OF YOU!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04307_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ending with a burst of love!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04308_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Hah...hah...hah...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04309_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wow, I can't remember the last time I shouted out so loud. I was even a bit nervous, to be honest.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04310_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You shouted pretty damn loud, considering your nerves. How you feeling now?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04311_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ah...yes, I think I feel a bit better now.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04312_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Since we're here, I'll shout something too.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04313_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "YODEL-AY-HEE-HEE!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04314_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, wow! You have quite an amazing singing voice!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04315_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well, that's about all I'm good at.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04316_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "All righty! Now all we need to do is get our bodies moving and our minds empty!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04317_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You mean exercise?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04318_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeah, we can go crazy here. I'll help ya out!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04319_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Okay, I will give it a try.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04320_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Phew, pretty slick moves, Icchi. How was it?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04321_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I feel so refreshed! But there's something I want to try.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04322_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wouldn't it be even better to move and shout at the same time?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04323_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I guess so. Okay, let's go another round.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04324_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "TAKE THIS!!! IS THAT ALL YOU GOT?! DON'T UNDERESTIMATE THE POWER OF A BIG SISTER!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04325_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Icchi...?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04326_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "*pant* *pant* Hey, Ruka... Can we go again?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04327_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Erm...sure.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04328_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutInWithAct:5",
      "Original": "I'LL TURN YOU INTO DIGITAL DETRITUS!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04329_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yikes... That was scary. I guess it's true. The quiet ones are usually the scariest ones when they're angry.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04330_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "O-Oh, I'm not angry or anything. It was all just for stress relief.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04331_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well, that's one way to put it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04332_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But that's the truth!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04333_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So, how are you feeling?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04334_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh... Now that you ask, I feel so light now. It's as I busted out everything that was pent up inside me.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04335_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That sounds kinda lewd. But as long as the stress is all out, then it's all okay! ",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04336_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Good... Now I can go back to my studies.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04337_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Just remember to be careful not to let stress get pent up like that anymore. You gotta take it easier.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04338_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes! Thank you so much!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04339_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But if I feel stressed again, would you mind helping me de-stress again?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04340_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "If you're fine with me helping, then sure.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04341_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04243_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "(Maybe I should invite Icchi to come for a soak.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Bath.BathQuestion:1",
      "Original": "Invite her?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Bath.BathQuestion:2",
      "Original": "Invite|Maybe not",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04244_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Hey, Icchi, wanna go to the baths together?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04344_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeah, sounds like the perfect break away from my studies.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Quest_Lv1_FMikoto_Quest_00067_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yay!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Quest_Lv1_IIshii_Quest_00076_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "(Nah, I'll bathe alone today.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04347_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ah...this is paradise... The stress is just melting out of me.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04348_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Why are you huddled in the corner again? You can enjoy this luxury more, y'know?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04349_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Didn't it feel good stretching out your legs last time?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04350_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes, very much so!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04351_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well...let's take it up a notch today.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04352_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "More than before?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04353_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeah, spread out your arms and legs like this. That'll melt all the stress away, for sure.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04354_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Like...some sort of starfish?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04355_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "O-Okay. Then I'll give it a go!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04356_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeah! Go for it!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04357_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Um...here we go!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04358_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, wow. That's even more impressive than I expected.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Common_04359_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Piipiipiipiipii BAAA pwiiGAApwiiGAApwii-PYSSHHHKKK.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
  "Inserts": []
}